# the Decay is not countered: it destroys Bot2's Ornithopter anyway.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Abrupt Decay
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Mana Leak
Island x16

